[{"title":"伤思吟 其二","author":"朱诚泳","text":"绛纱摇影夜灯红，霜冷芙蓉小帐空。\n无限幽怀何处著，沈沈都付漏声中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51992,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳絮","author":"朱诚泳","text":"颠狂已见随风起，飘荡还应逐水流。\n九十春光容易老，等閒莫点少年头。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51993,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔乐图","author":"朱诚泳","text":"钓丝轻飏碧波流，枫叶芦花两岸秋。\n占断一江风月在，浩歌长醉狎沙鸥。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51994,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"招阎文振方伯","author":"朱诚泳","text":"杖屦能来不厌频，玉醅银瓮正生春。\n长安此日耆英会，可少当年洛社人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51995,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"竹窗写兴","author":"朱诚泳","text":"锦绷初脱势凌云，劲节从来说此君。\n一点虚心能契我，开窗风月每平分。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51996,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"再到天池","author":"朱诚泳","text":"为爱云山几度来，芙蓉万朵插天开。\n出门满眼皆新句，不惜霜刀为剪裁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51997,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"曲江见杏花","author":"朱诚泳","text":"隔岸依稀见早霞，酒帘摇处两三家。\n马头駊騀行来近，始见前村有杏花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51998,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"访印鍊师不遇","author":"朱诚泳","text":"隔涧泠泠磬远闻，寻君惆怅未逢君。\n一声白鹤瑶天外，五粒松枝锁白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":51999,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄僧","author":"朱诚泳","text":"长安楼外见归鸿，几度登临忆远公。\n飞锡何时能过我，焚香相对夜谈空。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52000,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄王冢宰老先生","author":"朱诚泳","text":"堂堂世道藉扶持，八十悬车老盛时。\n见说蒲轮还有召，从来名节九重知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52001,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"幽居","author":"朱诚泳","text":"踏破苍苔一径深，满林晴翠昼阴阴。\n数声鸡犬柴门里，知是谁家傍水浔。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52002,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过景隆池","author":"朱诚泳","text":"雨花风叶堕芳池，景物凄凉石兽危。\n策马更从原上看，斜阳满地照残碑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52003,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梨花为风雨所败","author":"朱诚泳","text":"夜来风雨酿春寒，断送梨花满地残。\n最恨洗妆辜旧约，小轩诗酒共谁看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52004,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"菊","author":"朱诚泳","text":"瑟瑟西风不受欺，自缘晚节在东篱。\n何人更道无钱赏，况是参军落帽时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52005,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过古庙","author":"朱诚泳","text":"败壁颓垣半绿苔，行人过此暂徘徊。\n一龛冷落无香火，惟有栖鸦夜夜来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52006,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖图","author":"朱诚泳","text":"雨过西湖涨碧波，画船摇曳载笙歌。\n绿杨黄鸟苏堤外，想像诗成忆老坡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52007,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"二月花朝遇雪","author":"朱诚泳","text":"春到人间五十朝，桃花破萼柳垂条。\n东风何事犹吹雪，浪积墙阴未肯消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52008,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"红梅花","author":"朱诚泳","text":"自是孤山玉雪标，东风吹暖上林梢。\n夜深误入罗浮梦，两颊馀酣晓未消。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52009,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻鹤声","author":"朱诚泳","text":"玉宇凉生海月明，松梢忽听戛然鸣。\n坡仙赤壁孤舟夜，清梦惊回是此声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52010,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"阶前竹","author":"朱诚泳","text":"个个筼筜手自栽，绿阴密密护苍苔。\n小轩不独添佳致，还有丹山彩凤来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52011,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春晓","author":"朱诚泳","text":"林梢残月半窗明，枕上遥听好鸟鸣。\n起傍雕阑看春色，一庭花露滴无声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52012,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋晓","author":"朱诚泳","text":"唱彻金鸡曙色开，银灯犹自落寒煤。\n朱帘捲起梧桐月，满地清霜画角哀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52013,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"钓叟","author":"朱诚泳","text":"一叶扁舟覆短篷，钓丝轻飏柳花风。\n烟波不接云霄路，只恐非熊入梦中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52014,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"村行","author":"朱诚泳","text":"酒旗数尺飐东风，茅屋参差绿映红。\n春色满前吹不尽，紫骝嘶过小桥东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52015,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻砧","author":"朱诚泳","text":"满天风露月团团，双杵丁东捣夜阑。\n莫讶妾心何太急，玉门关外不胜寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52016,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"郊行即事","author":"朱诚泳","text":"宝马香车踏软尘，暖风不动趁游人。\n谁知陋巷柴门里，也有梨花一树春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52017,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴 其一","author":"朱诚泳","text":"日日钩帘独看山，笔床茶灶伴清閒。\n幽人自得圜中趣，身外纷纷总不关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52018,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴 其二","author":"朱诚泳","text":"漫把新诗信口裁，雅怀终日赖渠开。\n等闲拍手高歌处，招得空庭白鹤来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52019,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"午睡","author":"朱诚泳","text":"小窗一枕黑甜馀，正是黄莺唤起初。\n梦里谩劳寻旧约，殷勤重读寄来书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52020,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓起","author":"朱诚泳","text":"一枕钧天睡正浓，曙鸦啼散五更钟。\n朝廷有道边烽熄，閒散何妨自养慵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52021,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"述怀","author":"朱诚泳","text":"金阙琼台拥玉皇，群仙步武佩??。\n等閒也欲论封禅，虎卫无缘入建章。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52022,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春祭先茔途中遇雨","author":"朱诚泳","text":"十里松楸路不分，满天阴雨正纷纷。\n东风吹尽伤心泪，回首终南隔暮云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52023,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"尝新麦","author":"朱诚泳","text":"四月关西麦乍黄，晓炊愧我得先尝。\n淋漓汗血三农苦，空盼风吹饼饵香。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52024,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"道院见红梅","author":"朱诚泳","text":"姑射仙人著绛纱，冰霜满面绚红霞。\n丹成紫府应谁识，不比玄都观里花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52025,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦吟 其一","author":"朱诚泳","text":"笔床棐几日相亲，性癖耽诗四十春。\n独爱渊明冲淡趣，不将崎崛骇诗人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52026,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦吟 其二","author":"朱诚泳","text":"朝苦吟诗暮苦吟，苦吟却恐被诗淫。\n吟成字字皆粗拙，惭愧成周雅颂音。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52027,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"锦积堆为许季升题 其一","author":"朱诚泳","text":"东风花事已离披，绣出天然一段奇。\n彷佛灯笼媚妃子，当时不遣潞公知。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52028,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"锦积堆为许季升题 其二","author":"朱诚泳","text":"花神有意媚春天，种种珍奇色色妍。\n莫道霜台无著处，便同莲座供金仙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"