":"明"}},{"title":"清潭八景为朱景云宪副作 其四 中村牧篴","author":"朱诚泳","text":"山径萦迂草树重，参差茅屋乱烟中。\n斜阳晚饭行人断，无数牛羊一笛风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52048,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清潭八景为朱景云宪副作 其五 碧涧寒泉","author":"朱诚泳","text":"山下溶溶一脉连，分流长得过平田。\n遥看溅沫冰如结，疑是寒蛟水底眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52049,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清潭八景为朱景云宪副作 其六 清潭夜月","author":"朱诚泳","text":"月在长空水在潭，水光月色两相涵。\n潭中或有蛟龙起，倒射蟾精散蔚蓝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52050,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清潭八景为朱景云宪副作 其七 广济晨钟","author":"朱诚泳","text":"祠光曙色两平分，山下蒲牢到处闻。\n听说年来农事好，野人迎赛尽朝曛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52051,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"清潭八景为朱景云宪副作 其八 大桥车马","author":"朱诚泳","text":"绿树春江雨乍收，彩虹闪闪卧寒流。\n长途车马多於水，不解人间九折愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52052,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"明皇击节图","author":"朱诚泳","text":"醉倚梧桐击节时，翠盘妃子舞衣垂。\n渔阳莫怪胡尘起，梦里曾将尺八吹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52053,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"口占","author":"朱诚泳","text":"万事无能只守愚，年来更与世情疏。\n等閒欲射韩公策，已负平生未见书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52054,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题徐世良写生画","author":"朱诚泳","text":"意趣天然笔法奇，写生今复见徐熙。\n春花春鸟知多少，消得东君几句诗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52055,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"梅花图为宪佥胡用晦题","author":"朱诚泳","text":"剪雪裁冰巧作花，霜台人倚玉无瑕。\n须知鼎鼐调羹味，不落孤山处士家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52056,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张廷仪绣衣赏菊十二绝 其一","author":"朱诚泳","text":"占断西风第一芳，精神真欲傲严霜。\n红颜浪说天魔队，金粟如来独面黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52057,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张廷仪绣衣赏菊十二绝 其二","author":"朱诚泳","text":"东篱谁解惜芬芳，花未残时节未霜。\n珍重樽前论花品，行台今日有苏黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52058,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张廷仪绣衣赏菊十二绝 其三","author":"朱诚泳","text":"秋风谁敢擅幽芳，江上芙蓉亦怕霜。\n惟有东篱陶令菊，独将金色斗橙黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52059,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张廷仪绣衣赏菊十二绝 其四","author":"朱诚泳","text":"肯随桃李竞春芳，独倚东篱惯傲霜。\n试向牡丹园里看，空馀玉篆记姚黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52060,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张廷仪绣衣赏菊十二绝 其五","author":"朱诚泳","text":"传老元来有世芳，孙枝分出几星霜。\n姮娥只解誇仙桂，不道人间有鞠黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52061,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张廷仪绣衣赏菊十二绝 其六","author":"朱诚泳","text":"秋花妆点满篱芳，带土移来尚有霜。\n红紫不须争烂漫，独怜真色属金黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52062,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张廷仪绣衣赏菊十二绝 其七","author":"朱诚泳","text":"行台柱史振馀芳，怪底长安夜有霜。\n此日东篱同把酒，金英须避豸冠黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52063,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张廷仪绣衣赏菊十二绝 其八","author":"朱诚泳","text":"幽花向晚压群芳，青女相怜未著霜。\n珍重品题逢豸史，重来应见带围黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52064,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张廷仪绣衣赏菊十二绝 其九","author":"朱诚泳","text":"烂漫西风九月芳，锦围深护未经霜。\n花神不爱春前品，铸出金钱破眼黄。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":52065,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张廷仪绣衣赏菊十二绝 其十","author":"朱诚泳","text":"清才豸史漱清芳，口嚼